 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen Who Will Become the Source of Tragedy Will Devote Herself for the Sake of the People. Comic Anthology"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悲劇の元凶となる最強外道ラスボス女王は民の為に尽くします。 公式アンソロジーコミック"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Higeki no Genkyou to Naru Saikyou Gedou Last Boss Joou wa Tami no Tame ni Tsukushimasu. Anthology"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The popular novel, \"RasuTame\", written by Tenichi-sensei now has an anthology! Including original episodes with illustrations by many wonderful writers!!\nPryde's happy daily life is being delivered now ♪",
   "ja": "天壱先生著の大人気小説“ラス為”がアンソロジーコミックになって登場！\n豪華執筆陣によるオリジナルエピソード＆イラストを収録!!\nプライドと過ごすハッピーな日常をぎゅぎゅっとお届け♪"
  },
